{"name": "Skycore Reboot", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"121\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/b61e192006ecc4d06535dac9cedb5e04.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"770\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully plan your trip when you start! Routes are randomly generated in every single run in Skycore Reboot and bring different experiences. You can freely choose the branch way, whether to attack or avoid, but try your best to enhance yourself before the gate of Boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"460\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/b514ec176f8819a7b82f00d997435e06.poster.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/b514ec176f8819a7b82f00d997435e06.webm?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/b514ec176f8819a7b82f00d997435e06.mp4?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"121\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/94c9dfa068aa8a914311a69ff5a65b27.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"752\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly assemble fire, ice, thunder, or other elements skill in your trip, no matter grab them all or focus on your favourite one, just make a wise decision among the vast choices, and rampage on the battlefield with bullet hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"460\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/748aa3a4e7ea87d3f5fbd13937150bfa.poster.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/748aa3a4e7ea87d3f5fbd13937150bfa.webm?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/748aa3a4e7ea87d3f5fbd13937150bfa.mp4?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/e2c98a5cc74824a9d5dc3a4de8cb2d73.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"720\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every single skill could be enhanced and load the customized gears to get the new effect. Visit merchants and spend coin to promote your builds or explore unknown rooms to meet the mystery, even a power relic. Unleash your build\u2019s power, defeat enemies, and reach the peak by assembling your items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"460\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/52cf755e9df46ff7bd97cde7cc61f8ff.poster.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/52cf755e9df46ff7bd97cde7cc61f8ff.webm?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/52cf755e9df46ff7bd97cde7cc61f8ff.mp4?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"141\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/fbc259d18ec33472f0f5984dd751d5b3.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"594\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss has unique machines and logistics. Dodge to survive within their fierce attack and expose their weakness, then deliver your perfect shot with your excellent builds! Loop again and again, to rewrite the decided fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"460\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/bd693d8bac54a6f86b20c0b1507ce874.poster.avif?t=1782453265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/bd693d8bac54a6f86b20c0b1507ce874.webm?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/extras/bd693d8bac54a6f86b20c0b1507ce874.mp4?t=1782453265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Skycore Reboot is an action roguelike game centered on skill-building. You will venture through randomly generated floating cities, freely assembling acquired skills and equipment, defeating the ultimate magitek weapon, and rebooting the skycore to alter the fate of the falling sky islands.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179030/5304472cc8d783cb8d5ffe7c43a377b80581135b/header.jpg?t=1782453265", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Roguelite", "Action", "Roguelike", "Shoot 'Em Up"], "developers": "DB Studio", "publishers": "DB Studio", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4179030", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IWV5wIEYcno", "first_seen": 1780610400.0, "review_rank": 472}